gnd-voxel-color = The Palette Color of the voxel, and where on the model the shaded point is.
gnd-ambient-occlusion = How open the surface is: 1 in the open, lower in corners. The path tracer reports 1.
gnd-value = A constant number.
gnd-noise = Smooth random values from a position. Scale 1 is one noise cell per 8 voxels.
gnd-cells = Cellular pattern: distance to the nearest point, a random value per cell and the distance to the cell border.
gnd-gradient = Goes from 0 to 1 along an axis, between two positions given in voxels.
gnd-edge-wear = A mask that is 1 on voxel edges and fades inwards; breakup makes it irregular.
gnd-mix = Blends color B over color A by Factor.
gnd-color-ramp = Turns a number into a color by interpolating between stops.
gnd-hue-shift = Rotates the hue of a color by Shift degrees and scales its saturation and value.
gnd-remap = Maps a number from the From range to the To range.
gnd-multiply = Multiplies two numbers.
gnd-clamp = Limits a number to the range Min..Max.
gnd-voxel-bevel = Tilts the normal near voxel edges so they catch light as if rounded. Shading only, the geometry stays.
gnd-surface = Ends the Material: how the voxel's surface looks.
gnd-volume = Optional end of the Material: haze inside the voxel.

